1
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:12,600
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,760
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,300
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,830
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,270
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:30,110
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,170
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,390
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,910
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:47,070
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:50,200
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,560
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:57,320
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,610 --> 00:01:00,480
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,100
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,810
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:07,410
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:08,690
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,470
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:13,880
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:17,040
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:20,560
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:23,720
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:26,980
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:29,040
♪I travel north and south, witnessing
the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:32,520
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:36,120
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,130 --> 00:01:39,600
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,880
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:45,720
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,840
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:52,960
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:57,000
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 18=

34
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:58,520
Shen Lang.

35
00:01:59,440 --> 00:02:01,640
Don't die.

36
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:04,160
Ayao.

37
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,240
I'm sorry.

38
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:11,320
I have to avenge the princess.

39
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,440
The truth is, my feelings for you...

40
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,400
If I weren't who I am

41
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,360
and you weren't who you are,

42
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:29,600
perhaps I really could have been
your husband,

43
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:33,240
and stayed with you.

44
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,640
Shen Lang!

45
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:39,720
Shen Lang!

46
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:42,720
Little Alligator Dragon is ruthless.

47
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:44,240
Even as he's dying,

48
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:46,360
he's still playing the devoted lover
just to keep his bride hooked.

49
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:47,960
Shen Lang!

50
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:54,480
No!

51
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:57,400
Oh no!

52
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:59,120
Her demonic aura is surfacing!

53
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:00,160
He lied to you!

54
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:01,280
Don't believe him!

55
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,240
Exactly!

56
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,720
This is between us.

57
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,720
Stay out of it.

58
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:23,200
This is my pearl.

59
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,920
Use it to save my father.

60
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:30,560
But...

61
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:32,600
You'll die without it.

62
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:36,000
Life is nothing to mourn.

63
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:39,240
Death is nothing to fear.

64
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:54,160
That little fox is strange.

65
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:56,400
Why does she care so much about Ms. Ke?

66
00:03:58,160 --> 00:03:59,400
Let's save everyone first.

67
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:34,040
Mother, I'm right here!

68
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:35,480
Jinbao!

69
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,240
Father!

70
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:36,960
My daughter!

71
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:38,000
- Master!
- Master!

72
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:41,920
Master!

73
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:47,440
What happened that day was...

74
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:48,880
my wife had learned

75
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:51,240
she'd marry Little Alligator Dragon.

76
00:04:51,440 --> 00:04:52,400
She feared her clan

77
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:53,560
would find out about Ayao and me

78
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:54,760
and come after us.

79
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:55,600
So

80
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,240
she had no choice but to leave me.

81
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:00,360
This pearl

82
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:02,080
was a keepsake from my wife.

83
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:03,600
I didn't steal it.

84
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,360
Wait.

85
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,080
If that's true,

86
00:05:07,440 --> 00:05:08,920
how did your wife die?

87
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,480
She was already betrothed to me.

88
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:13,200
How could she marry someone else?

89
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,640
Her clan forced her to remarry.

90
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:16,920
She died of a broken heart.

91
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:21,200
To honor my wife,

92
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:22,720
I followed her clan's tradition

93
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:24,240
and began making Rouge Snow.

94
00:05:24,840 --> 00:05:26,360
I never expected people would

95
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,800
harvest so many pearls

96
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:29,240
and wipe out the clam spirits.

97
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:30,240
It's all my fault.

98
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,600
I brought this on Ayao.

99
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:34,240
I'll give up

100
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,280
everything I own

101
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:36,320
to protect the clam spirits

102
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:38,680
and atone for what I've done.

103
00:05:42,280 --> 00:05:43,440
Get up.

104
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,640
You know you were wrong.

105
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:47,080
Making amends is what matters.

106
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,800
So you're saying

107
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:51,085
if a clam spirit gives up its pearl,

108
00:05:51,086 --> 00:05:51,760
it won't die.

109
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:53,360
Then Ms. Ke

110
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:55,840
should be back with you soon.

111
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:58,360
Exactly, Master.

112
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:00,640
Ms. Ke can't defend herself.

113
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:01,680
Now that she's run away,

114
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,680
she must be missing meals.

115
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:06,280
She'll come home soon enough.

116
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:08,440
Hunger's the least of our worries.

117
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:10,240
What if traffickers get her

118
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,440
and sell her to a brothel?

119
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:14,440
My daughter!

120
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:15,760
Master!

121
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,640
Don't jinx her!

122
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,280
Help!

123
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:23,840
Monk!

124
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:24,880
What happened to you?

125
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:27,080
Three-Eyed Monster's been chasing me.

126
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:29,240
Three-Eyed Monster?

127
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:41,960
Well,

128
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:42,960
I'm not crazy, am I?

129
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,080
Guards!

130
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,080
Light the fire!

131
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:47,120
What fire?

132
00:06:47,377 --> 00:06:47,950
Wait.

133
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:49,640
Why am I in jail?

134
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,960
You've lost your powers,

135
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:54,760
and you're still putting on airs.

136
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:55,840
What happened?

137
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:56,880
Tell me the truth.

138
00:06:56,880 --> 00:06:57,320
Hey!

139
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,640
Isn't this all your fault?

140
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:01,800
You took my Linglong Pagoda

141
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:03,600
and made me fail my mission.

142
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:05,080
The Jade Emperor banished me here

143
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:06,680
and took my powers too.

144
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,040
Serves you right!

145
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,360
You're always stirring up trouble.

146
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:11,200
You brought this on yourself.

147
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,080
You're heartless!

148
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:14,000
You rotten monk!

149
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:16,600
Dragon-Subduing Arhat.

150
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:17,440
We're old friends.

151
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:20,240
Let me join you and serve Her Majesty.

152
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:21,560
You?

153
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:22,280
You opposed Her Majesty before.

154
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:25,600
She'd love to gouge out your third eye.

155
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,080
She even told me

156
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:28,200
she'd demote you to

157
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:29,440
Howling Celestial Dog's dog.

158
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:30,080
A dog?

159
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,000
A dog...

160
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,040
What's wrong with that?

161
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:35,840
What's wrong with being a dog?

162
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:36,880
Being a dog isn't so bad.

163
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:38,400
Better than being mortal, right?

164
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:43,840
(You think just anyone can be
Her Majesty's dog?)

165
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:44,880
Dragon-Subduing Arhat.

166
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:47,480
You really did me in.

167
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,640
Let's see where you can run now!

168
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:51,000
It was all a misunderstanding!

169
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:52,720
Little Alligator Dragon was behind it.

170
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:54,440
I've uncovered the truth.

171
00:07:54,960 --> 00:07:56,080
It doesn't matter who did it.

172
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:56,920
Her Majesty's temper...

173
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:57,680
You know what she's like.

174
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,360
To protect Her Majesty's honor,

175
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:01,040
you're done for.

176
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:04,487
Your Majesty,

177
00:08:04,487 --> 00:08:05,440
open wide.

178
00:08:07,273 --> 00:08:07,981
Ah.

179
00:08:11,805 --> 00:08:12,599
(Your Majesty.)

180
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:20,720
Your Majesty.

181
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:22,600
What just happened was...

182
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:24,640
What happened?

183
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:25,360
What are you talking about?

184
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,520
Nothing happened.

185
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:28,520
Right.

186
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:30,360
We...

187
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,560
- We saw nothing.
- We saw nothing.

188
00:08:32,560 --> 00:08:33,560
Didn't see a thing.

189
00:08:33,560 --> 00:08:34,840
Nothing at all.

190
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:38,320
Dragon-Subduing Arhat.

191
00:08:39,400 --> 00:08:40,360
Last time,

192
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:42,800
you made me lose all composure.

193
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,480
That's a capital offense.

194
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,440
Your Majesty,

195
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:48,360
that was all a misunderstanding.

196
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:50,920
But at least it showed the Jade Emperor

197
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:53,880
that I have plenty of admirers.

198
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:55,840
Exactly!

199
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:58,240
All Three Realms revere Your Majesty.

200
00:08:58,360 --> 00:09:01,680
No beauty in the Three Realms compares.

201
00:09:01,760 --> 00:09:03,480
The Jade Emperor must be blind.

202
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:04,840
How could he ignore

203
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:06,480
someone as adorable

204
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,360
as Your Majesty?

205
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,240
Seriously.

206
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,440
Insolence!

207
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,160
Show some respect!

208
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:10,880
Thunder God!

209
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:11,560
Slap him!

210
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,280
Yes, Your Majesty.

211
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:13,160
Wait!

212
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:14,760
I'll do it myself.

213
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:19,040
That's for running your mouth.

214
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:20,080
Happy now?

215
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:24,120
But men really are the worst...

216
00:09:28,640 --> 00:09:29,920
You're good to them,

217
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,600
and they take you for granted.

218
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:34,320
Make them think they're losing you,

219
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,240
and then they...

220
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,760
Her Majesty's angry one second
and smiling the next.

221
00:09:42,760 --> 00:09:44,360
Has she really gone crazy?

222
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:47,560
Here's what happened.

223
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:50,000
Her Majesty's adopted son

224
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:51,720
caused a huge scene in Heaven.

225
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:53,160
So the Jade Emperor

226
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:55,120
had to give in and cheer her up.

227
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:56,920
Yanzhi.

228
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,440
Have you packed everything?

229
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,000
Yes.

230
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:01,320
You're...

231
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,440
leaving?

232
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,720
Of course.

233
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:05,520
After all,

234
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:08,360
I still have to save his face.

235
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:10,280
If I really leave Heaven,

236
00:10:10,920 --> 00:10:12,280
the Three Realms will mock him.

237
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:15,320
That's true.

238
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:16,720
Well, since

239
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:17,960
you're leaving,

240
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,680
could you ask the Jade Emperor

241
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:21,240
to give me my powers back?

242
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:23,480
Speaking of powers...

243
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,280
Right.

244
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,320
I was just about to tell you.

245
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:28,680
My leaving Heaven

246
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:30,080
is all anyone's talking about.

247
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:30,720
So

248
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:31,160
right now,

249
00:10:31,160 --> 00:10:32,560
I need someone to take the fall.

250
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:33,960
Unfortunately,

251
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,160
that's you.

252
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,200
Me?

253
00:10:37,160 --> 00:10:37,800
Later,

254
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,280
I'll announce to all the gods

255
00:10:39,280 --> 00:10:41,320
that you lured me to the mortal world

256
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:43,840
to exploit our falling-out

257
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:45,520
and seize power for yourself.

258
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:47,360
Under the circumstances,

259
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:48,280
I don't think you'll

260
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:50,080
get your powers back anytime soon.

261
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,280
Bear with it a little longer.

262
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,480
So I'm still the one

263
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:55,280
who has to suffer through it all.

264
00:10:55,280 --> 00:10:56,440
But don't worry.

265
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:58,160
I'm not heartless.

266
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,880
You've lost your powers

267
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:01,920
and taken the fall.

268
00:11:02,560 --> 00:11:03,560
So I've decided

269
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:04,240
I might as well

270
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:06,040
take your disciple back with me

271
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:07,520
as my personal attendant.

272
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:09,800
Thank you, Your Majesty!

273
00:11:10,560 --> 00:11:12,080
Look how happy she is.

274
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,680
We're even now, right?

275
00:11:14,280 --> 00:11:16,440
Even you're leaving me?

276
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:19,360
A girl's got to move up in the world.

277
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:21,720
I can serve Her Majesty
as a celestial maiden.

278
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:23,280
Why stay with you and be a monk?

279
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:25,080
I've wanted to leave you for ages.

280
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:26,520
Fine, she can go.

281
00:11:26,520 --> 00:11:28,080
But can she stay?

282
00:11:32,520 --> 00:11:33,480
Dream on.

283
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:34,640
Keep whining,

284
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:36,680
and I'll really make you mortal.

285
00:11:36,680 --> 00:11:37,400
Move.

286
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:39,680
We're leaving.

287
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:54,200
Till mountains lose their peaks,

288
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:56,080
and heaven and earth unite,

289
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:58,880
only then will I part from you.

290
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,640
Shen Lang.

291
00:12:01,680 --> 00:12:03,920
We promised to be together forever.

292
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:06,280
Even though you lied to me,

293
00:12:08,400 --> 00:12:10,560
I won't let you leave this world

294
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:13,400
all alone.

295
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:16,800
In our next life,

296
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:20,080
may we be husband and wife again.

297
00:12:29,160 --> 00:12:29,960
Wait!

298
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:35,160
Why are you stopping me?

299
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:37,280
No matter what,

300
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:39,360
I can't let you die.

301
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:40,320
Without Shen Lang,

302
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,520
I won't go on living.

303
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:43,680
Wait.

304
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:48,600
I can save Shen Lang.

305
00:12:53,920 --> 00:12:54,640
(Ling'er)

306
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:57,640
(You were badly hurt saving Ke Ayao.)

307
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:58,920
(I, the Ancestor,)

308
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:01,440
(was able to turn Three-Headed Jiao
into a demon dragon.)

309
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:05,040
(So I can surely revive
Little Alligator Dragon.)

310
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:13,750
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

311
00:13:14,200 --> 00:13:17,010
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

312
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:20,810
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

313
00:13:20,860 --> 00:13:23,840
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

314
00:13:24,300 --> 00:13:31,050
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

315
00:13:31,070 --> 00:13:34,600
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

316
00:13:41,310 --> 00:13:44,510
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

317
00:13:44,540 --> 00:13:47,770
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

318
00:13:48,060 --> 00:13:51,080
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

319
00:13:51,090 --> 00:13:52,770
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

320
00:13:52,810 --> 00:13:54,690
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

321
00:13:54,730 --> 00:13:56,250
♪I left my wife behind♪

322
00:13:56,390 --> 00:13:57,850
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

323
00:13:57,890 --> 00:14:01,670
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

324
00:14:01,730 --> 00:14:02,810
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

325
00:14:02,820 --> 00:14:04,910
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

326
00:14:04,950 --> 00:14:06,610
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

327
00:14:06,650 --> 00:14:08,480
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

328
00:14:08,510 --> 00:14:11,840
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

329
00:14:11,880 --> 00:14:15,110
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

330
00:14:15,360 --> 00:14:18,240
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

331
00:14:18,260 --> 00:14:21,610
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

332
00:14:21,660 --> 00:14:25,270
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

333
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:28,620
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

334
00:14:28,660 --> 00:14:31,730
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

335
00:14:32,310 --> 00:14:35,360
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

336
00:14:35,380 --> 00:14:38,800
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

337
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:42,360
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

338
00:14:42,380 --> 00:14:45,840
♪You're just wasting your time♪

339
00:14:45,890 --> 00:14:48,810
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

340
00:14:48,860 --> 00:14:50,470
♪And I just laugh happily♪

341
00:14:50,500 --> 00:14:53,880
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

